        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6c09bd70-6670-486b-9222-15db93222b56).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, Gama provides care to multiple people around the world, sounds great, right? Gama is behind a lot of criminal scandals, they find themselves untouchable. You can prove them wrong. Your targets are the Lead Mortuary Doctor Kata, Head Of Security Shiki, Hospital Director Nakamura, Head Surgeon Doctor Laurant and Pilot Nails. Use any means neccesary to elimnate them, and bring justice to the victims of their treatment. The ICA also want their helicopter. Dont be seen, Good Luck 47.",
